														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3631816">
									

<p>&quot;For your own Morbid entertainment&quot;.</p>
<p>Its kind of sad how accurate that is. In any case, the concept of SCP-001 simply being a document defining what Is and Isn't anomalous is&#8230; actually kind of terrifying. All it would take is a few lines of words and bam, your now anomalous and being hunted down by the SCP organization, not to mention other groups like the Chaos Insurgency or Marshal, Carter, and Dark. All because a group of 13 decided to change up a small document a bit.</p>
<p>EDIT: Now that I think about it, at the beginning, we are included among many possible people who might be reading this article, so exactly who is reffered to by &quot;I still Love you&quot;?</p>

